{"records":[{"id":"n9w7zwc6pn","title":"raw data","description":"P4HB-Positive Classical Monocytes Drive the Sjögren’s Syndrome–Osteoarthritis Axis and Reveal a Druggable P4HB Signaling Network Through Virtual Gene Perturbation and Drug Repurposing","source":{"id":"7377952c-6404-4428-bbfc-77242cfc301e","name":"Mendeley Data","external":false},"publication_date":"2026-07-16T09:57:26.47Z","url":"https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/n9w7zwc6pn","data_type":"dataset","access":"open","doi":["10.17632/n9w7zwc6pn"],"contributors":[{"first_name":"yupei","last_name":"dai","orcid":null}],"funders":[],"categories":["Medicine","Addiction Medicine"],"journal_issn":[]},{"id":"bpcpfns6vb","title":"Global genetic interaction network of a human cell maps conserved principles and informs functional interpretation of gene co-essentiality profiles. Billmann et al.","description":"Deciphering how genes interact within human cells is essential for understanding their functional wiring and the development of targeted therapeutic strategies. In this study, we present a genome-scale map of genetic interactions in the human haploid cell line HAP1, based on CRISPR-based perturbation of ~ 4 million gene pairs. The resulting network comprises ~89,000 high-confidence gene-gene interactions, organizing genes into hierarchical modules corresponding to protein complexes and pathways, biological processes, and cellular compartments, mirroring principles observed in yeast and highlighting the functional architecture of a human cell. This large-scale genetic network complements the DepMap gene co-essentiality network by capturing unique functional information, uncovering roles of previously uncharacterized genes, and identifying molecular determinants of cancer cell line-specific genetic dependencies. This study presents a general data-driven strategy analysis for systematically exploring the roles of genes and their functional connections in human cell lines.","source":{"id":"7377952c-6404-4428-bbfc-77242cfc301e","name":"Mendeley Data","external":false},"publication_date":"2026-06-18T10:15:12.084Z","url":"https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/bpcpfns6vb","data_type":"dataset","access":"open","doi":["10.17632/bpcpfns6vb"],"contributors":[{"first_name":"Maximilian","last_name":"Billmann","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Michael","last_name":"Costanzo","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Xiang","last_name":"Zhang","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Arshia Z.","last_name":"Hassan","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Mahfuzur","last_name":"Rahman","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Kevin R.","last_name":"Brown","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Katherine S.","last_name":"Chan","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Amy Hin Yan","last_name":"Tong","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Carles","last_name":"Pons","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Henry N.","last_name":"Ward","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Catherine","last_name":"Ross","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Jolanda","last_name":"van Leeuwen","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Michael","last_name":"Aregger","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Keith A.","last_name":"Lawson","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Barbara","last_name":"Mair","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Amy F.","last_name":"Roth","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Nesli E.","last_name":"Sen","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Duncan T.","last_name":"Forster","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Guihong","last_name":"Tan","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Patricia","last_name":"Mero","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Sanna N.","last_name":"Masud","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Yoonkyu","last_name":"Lee","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Magali","last_name":"Aguilera-Uribe","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Matej","last_name":"Usaj","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Sylvia M. T.","last_name":"Almeida","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Kamaldeep","last_name":"Aulakh","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Urvi","last_name":"Bhojoo","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Saba","last_name":"Birkadze","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Nathaniel","last_name":"Budijono","orcid":null},{"first_name":"Xunhui","last_name":"C